## Build-context filter for LandWeb-standalone.Dockerfile (BuildKit reads it in place of a root
## .dockerignore). The workflow builds from a fresh checkout, which has none of these; they matter
## for a build from a working tree, which would otherwise copy the host's renv library, secrets,
## host config and data links into the image.

## renv library and staging (the image restores its own)
renv/library/
renv/staging/
renv/sandbox/

## secrets and host config
**/*.Renviron
.httr-oauth*
landweb-*.json
drive-sa*.json
_hosts.R
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/

## data, pipeline store, logs and scratch
inputs
outputs
outputs_v2
_targets
cache
logs
_tmp*
_TODO_*

## rendered manual, build caches and editor state
docs
manual/*_cache
manual/*_files
manual/_bookdown_files
.quarto
.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.superpowers
.vscode
